      "Instolutions 3.0 was conducted on the 21st of April 2025 at Alpha Engineering College, bringing together students from various institutions for a dynamic exchange of ideas and innovation. Among the participants were Yuva members from different colleges, including a passionate team from Yuva REC. The event began in the presence of Yi officials, Mr. Rishi Dev Ratan and Mr. Srvinayakram, the Chair of Yi Innovation and Yi Climate Change Vertical, whose involvement enriched the experience. Their presence added depth and direction through their guidance, setting an inspiring tone for the day. Building on this spirit of innovation, Instolutions 3.0 served as a unique platform where students and companies came together to co - create practical solutions through design thinking. Participants were grouped randomly and matched with companies such as Ondru and VLeaf, with each team assigned a real - world problem statement. They worked through every stage of the design thinking process, bringing forward impactful solutions and fresh approaches. Following the engaging presentations, the judging panel provided valuable observations and encouraged deeper thinking and refinement. The winning teams were awarded certificates and medals in recognition of their outstanding efforts, while all the participants received certificates of participation as a token of appreciation for their involvement. Instolutions 3.0 stood as a vibrant expression of creativity, teamwork and purpose - driven problem solving, reaffirming the potential of young minds when industry and innovation intersect."
