      "The Road Revive was a roaring and highly alarming event taken forward by the students of Yi YUVA of Rajalakshmi Engineering College. This event commenced around 8am at Anna Arch, Chennai on 22.1.2023(Sunday). It comprised of a package of activities including a rally to advocate the importance of road safety to people. The rally started from Anna Arch via Naduvankarai and back to Anna Arch. This event took place between 8 to 9.30 AM. Strong message about road safety was delivered using pluck cards. A mime act by the YUVA club members was put on stage which intrigued the audience and instilled the importance of road safety in them.Post this a small interaction with police officials and public was held regarding the road safety measures and personal experience of road accidents which was captured followed by distribution of key chains written with impactful message. Altogether the event turned out to be a successful one by making an impact in the society."
